      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "XinZhaoW",
        "name": "Wind Becomes Lightning",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Xin Zhao slashes in front of himself with his spear, then thrusts it forward, slowing affected enemies and marking them as Challenged.",
        "bodyHtml": "Xin Zhao slashes, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/40/50/60/70 + (30% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>, then thrusts, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50/85/120/155/190 + (90% Attack Damage) + (65% Ability Power)) × (1 + 33.3% Critical Strike Chance)</span>. Enemies hit by the thrust are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by -5000% for (1.5 + (0.5% Ability Power)) seconds. <br /><br />Champions and Large Monsters hit by the thrust are marked as <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Challenged</span> for 3 seconds and revealed unless <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Stealthed</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The thrust's damage is increased by up to 33.3% based on Xin Zhao's Critical Strike Chance.<br />Deals 53.34% damage to minions.<br />Applies Lifesteal at 33% effectiveness on both attacks.</span>",
