        "name": "Crescent Guard",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Xin Zhao passively challenges an enemy he damaged recently. When activated, Xin Zhao deals damage to nearby enemies based on their current Health and knocks non-challenged targets back, becoming impervious to damage dealt by champions outside of the circle created.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> The last champion Xin Zhao damaged with an Attack or <span>Audacious Charge</span> is <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Challenged</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Xin Zhao unleashes a sweep around him that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(75/175/275 + (100% bonus Attack Damage) + (110% Ability Power)) plus 15% current Health physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Back</span> all <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">non-Challenged</span> enemies. <br /> <br />Afterwards, Xin Zhao becomes immune to damage from enemies outside the sweep range for 4 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a max of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">600 damage</span> to jungle monsters and minions.</span>",
